{"title": "Tough", "pageid": 4946, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tough", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tough.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Tough.webp/300px-Tough.webp, /w/images/7/71/Tough.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/71/Tough.webp/300px-Tough.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/71/Tough.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Tough</b> is a passive feature obtainable by a <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. Users of this feature have extra <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a> per character level.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Point</a> maximum increases by 2 for every level you have gained. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Tough_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tough (Feat)\">Tough (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Faril\" title=\"Faril\">Faril</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Golbraith_Stredivas\" title=\"Golbraith Stredivas\">Golbraith Stredivas</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zevlor\" title=\"Zevlor\">Zevlor</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This bonus applies retroactively to all levels gained by the character, including Level 1. For example, selecting this Feat at Level 8 will instantly add 16 maximum HP (in addition to 8 more maximum HP gained from levelling from Level 9 to Level 12).</li>\n<li>This effect does not work while in <a href=\"/wiki/Wildshape\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wildshape\">Wildshape</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714212846\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 463/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2333/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1730/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 259/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 645115/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.510      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   26.510      1 -total\n 16.07%    4.261      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 14.57%    3.864      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.40%    3.816      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 13.47%    3.571      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  7.51%    1.990      3 Template:IfEmpty\n  7.06%    1.872      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n  6.17%    1.636      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n  1.24%    0.328      1 Template:Clear\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4946-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714212846 and revision id 168655. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}